msg: Channel schedule → future program → \"Record\" badge → OK. The \"Reminder and series recording\" row below the program also allows a notification only at start (without recording) and recording all episodes with the same title. Recordings start on their own and stop at the end of the program. One at a time: recording while watching another channel may fail if the provider allows only 1 connection.

